OL,3,GNEWSAIncinerator opponents fear forever
OL,4,Achemicals
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to burn "forever chemicals" at a
OL,7,Fwaste incinerator, revealed in
OL,8,Fdocuments supporting a licence
OL,9,Fapplication for the new facility, have
OL,10,Fled to contamination fears among nearby
OL,11,Fresidents.
OL,13,FThe plant on Heighington Lane in Newton
OL,14,FAycliffe, County Durham, has been built
OL,15,Fand operator Fornax is awaiting a
OL,16,Fpermit from the Environment Agency
OL,17,F(EA), which the organisation said it is
OL,18,F"minded" to approve.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39302
SC,0002
