OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIncinerator opponents fear forever
OL,4,Achemicals
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpponents have picked up on plans to
OL,7,Fburn per- and polyfluoroalkyl
OL,8,Fsubstances (PFAS), including banned
OL,9,Ffirefighting foam, which can have
OL,10,Fnegative effects on the environment.
OL,12,FAs a second public consultation nears
OL,13,Fcompletion, Fornax and the EA said the
OL,14,Fplant has been designed to safely
OL,15,Fdestroy PFAS.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
